Maintainer: Ze Lin <zlin5858@163.com>
Description: Regression models to assess the effect of covariates on the
 Pearson correlation coefficient for bivariate normal and bivariate
 binary responses.  The package provides likelihood-based inference
 using Newton-Raphson estimation and bootstrap-based significance
 testing, with robust handling of numerical instabilities in extreme
 samples.  The methodology is based on Dufera, Liu, and Xu (2023)
 "Regression models of Pearson correlation coefficient"
 <doi:10.1080/24754269.2023.2164970>.
